{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I don't know where I am. Strange symbols burn into my vision. I hear a bird calling out in the void... But one thing I know for certain: I will save my brother.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apathic</strong> is a first-person psychological horror and investigative game where running away is not enough you must bend reality to survive. Plunged into a dark, abandoned facility, you will face surreal environments and deadly traps in search of your missing brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RULES OF SURVIVAL HAVE CHANGED</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this nightmare, you must master your surroundings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift Gravity:</strong> The floor is just a suggestion. Invert the world, manipulate gravity, and access impossible locations to solve reality-defying puzzles and escape traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Enemy That Learns:</strong> You are not dealing with a scripted AI. A strange creature is always hunting, always watching, and adapting to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nowhere is Safe:</strong> It uses its sight to track you. Whether you are on the floor, clinging to the ceiling, or hiding in the shadows, it will find you. You must outsmart it, distract it, or use the environment against it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for an intense atmospheric horror experience where technology turns reality into a living nightmare.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2667360?t=1772430520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/1955e2bd4fb9feda80f2d5ea06ddc5bc77bc992b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772430520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/10f8dc133f0fb7885b33927045b8ded8466d48e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772430520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/10f8dc133f0fb7885b33927045b8ded8466d48e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772430520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3944770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;I don't know where I am. Strange symbols burn into my vision. I hear a bird calling out in the void... But one thing I know for certain: I will save my brother.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/041e661056cd292f74db0bf9204e446b.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apathic</strong> is a first-person psychological horror and investigative game where running away is not enough you must bend reality to survive. Plunged into a dark, abandoned facility, you will face surreal environments and deadly traps in search of your missing brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/1d97a04035d9ce7ef3fa673d96f76948.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE RULES OF SURVIVAL HAVE CHANGED</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this nightmare, you must master your surroundings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift Gravity:</strong> The floor is just a suggestion. Invert the world, manipulate gravity, and access impossible locations to solve reality-defying puzzles and escape traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.poster.avif?t=1772430520\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.webm?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/extras/414c444407e3c0b993928a4fa101995c.mp4?t=1772430520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Enemy That Learns:</strong> You are not dealing with a scripted AI. A strange creature is always hunting, always watching, and adapting to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nowhere is Safe:</strong> It uses its sight to track you. Whether you are on the floor, clinging to the ceiling, or hiding in the shadows, it will find you. You must outsmart it, distract it, or use the environment against it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for an intense atmospheric horror experience where technology turns reality into a living nightmare.</p>","developers":["Ation Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667360/bac95b5cec59116766f9fa210497db1db3c5a369/header.jpg?t=1772430520","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Ation Studios - 2026 - All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04, CentOS 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04, CentOS 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></